### Supported Agents

Listed as Supported in the Qovery skills compatibility table: Claude Code (Recommended), OpenCode, Cursor, VS Code Copilot, Gemini CLI, Roo Code, Goose, Amp, Junie (JetBrains), Kiro, OpenHands, OpenAI Codex, Mistral Vibe, TRAE.

Plus any tool that discovers skills from `.claude/skills/`, `.config/opencode/skills/` or `.agents/skills/`, and any client that speaks the Model Context Protocol.

Agents authenticate with their own API tokens, do not consume user seats, inherit scoped RBAC, and are audited exactly like human users.

